Package: libtllist-dev
Version: @DEB_TLLIST_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/dnkl/tllist
Description: Typesafe intrusive linked-list C library (headers)
 tllist is a single-header, typesafe, intrusive doubly-linked-list implementation
 in C, by foot's author. Header-only: this package ships tllist.h and its
 pkg-config file, used to build fcft and foot.
